# Supabase rules

Follow `docs/architecture/SCHEMA_WORKFLOW.md` and `DATA_MODEL.md`.

- Source of truth: `supabase/schemas/*.sql` → migrations → commit.
- Apply only to project ref `qnoeiurmyyyuawkcifmw`. Never `bkdzeihxzvrkndjvyzye`.
- After schema changes: generate and commit TS types; run security advisors (MCP).
- RLS on all user tables; explicit GRANTs (auto-expose is off).
- Do not edit production schema only in the Dashboard.
- Store only ciphertext + allowed metadata for encrypted entities.
